### Secrets — NEVER commit
# Only the secrets file is ignored. Development/Alpha/Beta/Release.xcconfig are
# COMMITTED on purpose — they hold URLs, bundle ids and flags, and you want to see
# in review when a variant changes which environment it points at.
#
# Matched by NAME, not by path, so moving the Config folder cannot silently
# un-ignore it — which is exactly what happened once already.
Secrets.xcconfig